 "content": "다음을 계산하시오.\n⑴ $8x^{3}\\times\\frac{1}{4}xy^{2}$ ⑵ $-2x^{4}y\\times(-7xy^{3})$\n⑶ $(-3a^{3})^{2}\\times 2ab^{2}$ ⑷ $(2ab^{2})^{2}\\times(-a^{3}b)^{3}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $2x^{4}y^{2}$ ⑵ $14x^{5}y^{4}$ ⑶ $18a^{7}b^{2}$ ⑷ $-4a^{11}b^{7}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $8\\times\\frac{1}{4}\\times x^{3}\\times x\\times y^{2}=2x^{4}y^{2}$ ⑵ $(-2)\\times(-7)\\times x^{4}\\times x\\times y\\times y^{3}=14x^{5}y^{4}$ ⑶ $9a^{6}\\times 2ab^{2}=18a^{7}b^{2}$ ⑷ $4a^{2}b^{4}\\times(-a^{9}b^{3})=-4a^{11}b^{7}$",
